'handlers/stria/src/nle_face.rs (the VERBS line and the verb arm IN PLACE; `doc_path`, `dirty`, the save fn at the FILE TAIL under a named block comment), vessels/stria-view/src/main.rs (doc_path into the Face, the Save button in transport(), the witness JSON field; in place), handlers/stria/tests/nle.rs (tail), docs/dev/blueprint/handlers.md (§5 row L84 the two NLE-HOST-SAVE mentions IN PLACE: `NLE-HOST-SAVE BUILT by SR677 (...)`), docs/dev/LEDGER.md (SR677 at the END). Shared with NLEPLAYAUDIO on nle_face.rs (it edits Face::tick / play; you edit VERBS / verb; both append tail blocks: name yours) and on stria-view main.rs (it adds --mute / resonance; you add the button and doc_path: separate lines).',
